WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.734
-I'd like to take a moment to
thank some of our sponsors

00:00:02.734 --> 00:00:04.067
for tonight's show.

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:05.701
They don't always get to fit
in the commercial breaks,

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:07.601
and we want to make sure that
we mention all of them,

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.601
so it's time for
"Tonight Show Sponsors."

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:10.567
Here we go.

00:00:10.567 --> 00:00:13.167
-♪ Tonight Show sponsors ♪

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:16.033
♪ Tonight Show sponsors ♪

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:17.534
[ Applause ]

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:19.767
-Arby's. Why roast beef?

00:00:19.767 --> 00:00:22.000
Well, first of all, thanks
for assuming that it is.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:25.801 --> 00:00:28.868
Shell -- Our gas is now 50 cents
higher than it was

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:30.434
at the beginning
of this sentence.

00:00:30.434 --> 00:00:34.200
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.100
Michelin -- We make tires
and review restaurants.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.334
It just makes sense.

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:41.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:44.067
Pita Chips --
Don't have any hummus?

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.300
LOL, enjoy.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:49.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:49.167 --> 00:00:51.567
Hewlett-Packard -- We're pretty
much screwed whenever

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.100
Apple decides to make printers.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.567 --> 00:01:00.367
Wells Fargo --
Oh, you want to withdraw $20?

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:01.901
That'll be $35.

00:01:01.901 --> 00:01:05.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:05.901 --> 00:01:09.100
Alka-Seltzer -- Plop, plop,
fizz, fizz, sorry for the noise.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.100
We know you're hungover.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:17.133
Expo Dry Erase Markers --
Always works the first time.

00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:19.667
The second time? Well, that's
where the game begins.

00:01:19.667 --> 00:01:24.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.934
Go-Gurt -- Ever wanted to "milk"
your afternoon snack

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:28.100
out of a plastic udder?

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:33.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:35.834
-Udder.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.367
-Bed, Bath, and Beyond --

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:40.067
We've got everything you'll
throw away next time you move.

00:01:40.067 --> 00:01:44.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.567
Also sponsored by crypto.com.

00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.634
Hey, does anybody want to buy
a basketball arena?

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:52.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:52.434 --> 00:01:54.901
Ann Taylor --
Be a lady in the streets,

00:01:54.901 --> 00:01:56.667
a coastal grandma in the sheets.

00:01:56.667 --> 00:02:01.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:04.467
IKEA -- furniture guaranteed to
fall apart slightly less quickly

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:05.701
than your relationship.

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:09.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:11.968
Trader Joe's -- Oh, you like
that thing you bought here?

00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:13.467
Oh, we'll never carry it again.

00:02:13.467 --> 00:02:17.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:20.033
And finally, Twitter --
The countdown to you

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:23.133
getting fired over something
you said on here starts...now.

00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:26.133
There you go. Thank you, all of
our "Tonight Show" sponsors.

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:27.133
Thank you very much.

